# Development Folder (Ignored until ready)
US ETF Portfolio Dashboard/

# Retired pickle caches — replaced by version-robust Parquet (nav_*.parquet).
# Ignored so the corrupt/stale local copies never get re-committed.
*.pkl.gz

# ── Supabase-backed data — NOT duplicated in the repo ────────────────────────
# The monthly composition history lives in the private bucket at
# "ETF Data/composition/{SYMBOL}.parquet". The local folder is only a scratch
# working copy that each run pulls down and pushes back, so it must never be
# committed — the bucket is the single source of truth.
composition/

# Per-ETF composition JSON the site reads. Served live from Supabase via the
# netlify.toml /details/* proxy, so committed copies would only go stale.
details/
